## Docs

The documentation site lives in `zdocs/` and is built with
[Zola](https://www.getzola.org/):

```bash
cd zdocs
zola serve
```
{%- if docs_hosting == 'github-pages' %}

The site is built and deployed to GitHub Pages by
`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`. You have to tell GitHub to use the `main` branch
as the source for the GitHub Pages site: Settings → Pages → Build and
deployment → Source → deploy from a branch → main
{%- elif docs_hosting == 'gitlab-pages' %}

The site is built and deployed to GitLab Pages by `.gitlab-ci.yml`.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
